    "__comment": "The home dashboard, provisioned from grafana/provisioning/dashboards and named by default_home_dashboard_path in grafana.ini. It replaces Grafana's built-in home page, whose \"Basics\" cards are compiled into the frontend bundle and cannot be added to. The cards here are plain HTML in a text panel, so a new one is an edit to this file. They carry inline style attributes because the panel's sanitizer drops a <style> block, and their links are absolute below GRAFANA_PATH, as Grafana's own dashboard URLs are: a relative href resolves against the current dashboard's URL and 404s.",
