                "content": "\n<h1 style=\"font-size:1.6rem;margin:0 0 .25rem 0;\">Welcome to ${APP_NAME}</h1>\n<p style=\"color:#9aa0a6;margin:0 0 1.25rem 0;\">Dashboards, data and analytics for your projects.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;\">\n<a style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:240px;padding:1rem 1.15rem;border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);border-radius:4px;background:rgba(127,127,127,.07);text-decoration:none;\" href=\"/${GRAFANA_PATH}/d/${APP_NAME}-server-monitoring\"><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.3rem;\">Server monitoring</div><div style=\"color:#9aa0a6;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.35;\">How much CPU, memory and disk the server is using, and how that is trending.</div><div style=\"color:#6ccf8e;font-size:.82rem;margin-top:.5rem;\">&#10003; ready</div></a>\n<a style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:240px;padding:1rem 1.15rem;border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);border-radius:4px;background:rgba(127,127,127,.07);text-decoration:none;\" href=\"/${GRAFANA_PATH}/dashboards\"><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.3rem;\">Browse dashboards</div><div style=\"color:#9aa0a6;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.35;\">Every dashboard on the system, including the ones your team has built.</div></a>\n<a style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 260px;min-width:240px;padding:1rem 1.15rem;border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);border-radius:4px;background:rgba(127,127,127,.07);text-decoration:none;\" href=\"/${GRAFANA_PATH}/d/${APP_NAME}-ai-assistant\"><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.3rem;\">Add the MCP server to your AI</div><div style=\"color:#9aa0a6;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.35;\">Let Claude or Copilot read and build dashboards for you &mdash; with exactly your own permissions.</div></a>\n</div>\n"
